tskirts of the French Quarter. I ordered quite a few drinks and they were all delicious. The bartender makes a good effort perfecting the drink for you. Also they have fairly priced drink specials at $5"},{"business_id":"wQNkpi9RvpuoiDB-CiHxog","review_id":"AwcWMp2pExWb8rfL8JFW9Q","date":"2015-02-10T16:57:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9372192621231079,"text_excerpt":"My favorite cocktail bar in the city. Located a decent way from all the other bar affair of the French Quarter, it offers a bit more classy-casual feeling with some great drinks. The long and short of it: 1. Sazerac. I personally think their sazerac is the best in the city. The flavors are well balanced and it's always smooth. 2. Cocktails. Expertly crafted cocktails with great attention to detail. The bartenders here know what they're doing, and the final product always looks and tastes great. Noteable was the Kelly's Surprise, a great refreshing summer drink. 3. Atmosphere. Small and cozy, yet classy. It takes the best of both the upscale and casual worlds 4. Specials. Daily $5 drink sp..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"wQNkpi9RvpuoiDB-CiHxog","photo_id":"tGjwnlUQZ7QNyUqTceahPQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/tGjwnlUQZ7QNyUqTceahPQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9244384169578552},{"business_id":"wQNkpi9RvpuoiDB-CiHxog","photo_id":"wwO7KhuoPhou5pZuD_MqhA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/wwO7KhuoPhou5pZuD_MqhA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9046781659126282},{"business_id":"wQNkpi9RvpuoiDB-CiHxog","photo_id":"eGne9YcMUzFHow5BBmi2XQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/eGne9YcMUzFHow5BBmi2XQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8925722241401672},{"business_id":"wQNkpi9RvpuoiDB-CiHxog","photo_id":"GWvThb9PBiQdBtZC0Nk8lw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/GWvThb9PBiQdBtZC0Nk8lw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8636136054992676},{"business_id":"wQNkpi9RvpuoiDB-CiHxog","photo_id":"ZC3k3Bj4vaCTdMR0DiApyw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ZC3k3Bj4vaCTdMR0DiApyw.jpg","